Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,(十年前)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈永远都不会懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing a father wouldn't do for his son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:01:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲对儿子是毫无保留的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother never understood this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她把你当成了怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She looked at you and saw a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,而我看到的是潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw potential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,强盗要是抢了你的钱 弄瞎他的眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When a bully took your money, you took his eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要是敢说你疯了 割了他们的舌头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they called you crazy, you took their tongues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,今天把你带到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I brought you here today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.28,0:01:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是显示我的慷慨吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it generosity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还是我的爱吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.62,0:01:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是告诉你 我的一切不会随我而逝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so what I built doesn't die with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,属于我的一切都会给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So my legacy can live on,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是父子传承的意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because a father and his son is everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一个活 只能托付给唯一信任的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a job that I can only trust with one man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.51,0:01:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我手下最精锐的守卫在保护着我们的金库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My most ruthless soldiers were watching our cash houses,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们让这个多米尼克·托雷托烧了属于我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they let this Dominic Toretto burn what is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了多米尼克·托雷托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们都杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill 'em all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.23,0:01:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们？ 你会宽恕他们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill them? You'd show them mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.85,0:01:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.40,0:01:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,当你遭受了痛苦 不要把死亡作为回击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When suffering is owed, never accept death as a payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,应该让托雷托也尝一下你受到的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make Toretto suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.99,0:02:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,(里约热内卢)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.53,0:02:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,(警察局)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.55,0:02:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,现在开始行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the work begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那么从今天起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我们要让我们的家族走上真正的权力之路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}today we'll put our family on a path to real power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有人要抢金库
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-有人要抢金库 -什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.19,0:03:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,抢金库
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在桥上他们跑不过我们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他们人太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, there's too many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们跑不掉了 -我们是跑不掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're not gonna make it. - You're right. We aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-但你可以 -我不能丢下你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are. - No, I'm not leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要按照计划来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you stick with the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was always the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.55,0:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他们跑不掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,《速度与激情10》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.82,0:06:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,(洛杉矶)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你学会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本没学会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人一生下来就会开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B, no one starts at the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,要对此有信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,记住今天的经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember today's lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,找准线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the line,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,感受车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}feel the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,飞速疾驰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and let it fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.83,0:07:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-害怕也没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's okay to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候恐惧就是最好的老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes fear can be the best teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我没害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁都有害怕的时候 -你没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everyone gets scared, son. - You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来没害怕过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.84,0:07:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,曾祖母坐飞机来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great-Grandma just flew in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她要做拿手菜炸甜蕉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she's making her famous maduros.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,得在罗曼叔叔吃光前赶回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to get to those before Uncle Roman does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.61,0:07:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在知道害怕了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's something to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经死过一回了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have been dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-该焕发活力了 -我早说过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's time to get you living. - Told you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,给你  资料填好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, profile done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不用客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一般等上个三四天就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you give it about three, four days...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会这么快撩你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It never happens instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,(配对成功)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.57,0:08:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,让我再看看你的头像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see your profile picture again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定是开滤镜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have put a filter on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在看什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you guys looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-停下  不要不要不要看 -我们只是在玩游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, wait. No, no, no, no. - They're just video games, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-等会先别看 -只是普通的游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- H-H-Hold on, man. - Just videos, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我能坐你旁边吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I sit next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.79,0:08:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你会漂移了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You drifting yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你在就好了  我刚才可厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've seen us. It was so cool, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.07,0:08:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}!¡Oye, familia!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.45,0:08:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀我快饿死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想和你们所有的人好好拥抱一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also want a hug from every single person in--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  好久不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.18,0:08:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-啊  -你看到排的队了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah. - You see the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,都排队等着抱抱呢  祖母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all waiting in line for this love, abuelita.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.57,0:08:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦  太好了 -等着你们品尝呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, yeah. - Wait till you taste this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,太好吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我费了好大的功夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put myself out for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好了各位先安静一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, everybody pipe down, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,祖母有话想要对大家说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abuelita would like to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.89,0:09:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,都先安静一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piping and downing, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,每当我看着这优秀的一家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I look out at this wonderful family,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我都会感觉到特别骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am filled with so much pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-要是我的儿子 -你们的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kind of pride that my son-- your father--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还活着他也肯定会骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would have enjoyed if he were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们这一路走来很不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that this road has been very hard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还遇到了很多不公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and also not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们还是走到了今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet here you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.61,0:09:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,克服了重重困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}despite all of the odds,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,做出了非常伟大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}building this magnificent
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,成......\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,做出的成就将会一代一代流传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a legacy that will go on for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,谁也夺不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one can take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.59,0:09:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还是未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.05,0:10:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,为家人干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To familia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,干杯 干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Familia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,永远是一家人干杯干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Siempre. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哎我今天穿了新鞋哦  别玩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, these new Nikes, man. Stop playing! Goddamn...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样罗恩 特工局让你指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Roman. The agency put you in charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你说让我开车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you said I get to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我真正需要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, what I really need
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是你的头脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is I need your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.65,0:10:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,罗曼皮尔斯头一回说这种话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Words Roman Pearce has never said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯再跟我说一遍 说详细一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So talk me through it again. I need details.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  特工局收到了有关被窃军事硬件的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the agency got a tip on some stolen military hardware.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一辆载有下一代计算机芯片的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow, a next-gen quantum computer chip
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.28,0:10:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,明天会出现在罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be transported through the streets of Rome,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们负责偷芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they need us to steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我查过罗曼的情报了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I checked Roman's intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,当然没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course it's legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.74,0:10:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟那是罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking 'bout Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马 罗曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rome. Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这次的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,简单的就像抢劫自家后院一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's like planning a heist in my backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你唯一知道的不过是罗马两个字怎么写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only thing you know about Rome is "ro-man" noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.78,0:10:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有件事你还没有跟我们解释清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing you didn't explain to us is:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么需要无线电遥控车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell do we need a RC car,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.20,0:10:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,黄金兰博基尼还有12罐笑气-好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a gold Lamborghini and 12 tanks of laughing gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我参加 你确实需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm in, 'cause you are definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有脑子的人来帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}going to need all the brains you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,净出馊主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-哎 罗曼 -别跟我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Hey, Rome... - Don't talk to me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:10:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.97,0:11:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吧 -都听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都给我放尊重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The disrespect is gon' have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,现在开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是我的--你们都听明白了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just my-- You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在练习怎么说话听起来像老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me just, you know, practicing my leadership voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,特尔佳  你别以为自己很聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tej, you think you slick, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.61,0:11:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来探我的底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spying on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么装了个古董\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up with this old boat anchor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不带燃油喷射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No fuel injection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为按你的水平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I'd expect something bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,会装的规格更高的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and better from you, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.65,0:11:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我和小布在一起组装这辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little B and I are building it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,化油器这玩意能让他乖乖听我话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The carburetor forces him to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是现在年轻人的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the problem nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-没人愿意听话了 -那你得小心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nobody listens anymore. - Well, you better watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.11,0:11:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,等他长到12岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little man's gonna be a better wrench than any of us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他的改装水平肯定超过我们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the time he's 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才要培养他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, that's the whole point, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,传承下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.53,0:11:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,下一代会比我们更强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each generation better than the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fatherhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,当初在多米尼家偷油罐车的小贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come a long way from the two of us popping gas trucks
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-竟然走到了现在 -谁能想到啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- in the D.R., huh? - We sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候可真不容易啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those were some tough times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:11:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候也很幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those were some great times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.17,0:12:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们你们俩在开会吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you... Y-Y'all was in a meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我没想打扰你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I-I ain't want to interrupt y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,韩 我们该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Han, let's go, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,罗曼想要指挥这次任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roman asked if he could lead this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么能拒绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could I tell him no?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.32,0:12:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但得有你陪他们去我才放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know I can't let them go to Rome without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,当一辈子洛城飞贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Los bandoleros for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.71,0:12:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,当一辈子洛城飞贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lo bandolero for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.98,0:13:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你给他争光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You honor his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.62,0:13:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们牢牢记在心里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold us in your heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你就永远不会迷路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you will never lose your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你会比我厉害的多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will be better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你在看什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-孩子睡了 -然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kid's asleep. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能越来越漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you get more beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有宝宝了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.11,0:14:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,要宝宝需要时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll come when the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我和小布练车的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when we were in the car today...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,小家伙说,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...B said, "Daddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:14:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么都不怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're never afraid."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但其实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我会害怕失去儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid of losing a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,失去妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那种事不会再发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not gonna happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你想  你可以一直紧紧盯着后视镜看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can keep your eyes on that rearview all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.59,0:15:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但这样会错过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know what you miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,眼前的美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.08,0:15:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,既是永恒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.01,0:16:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你现在一样惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm as surprised as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我想过上千次怎么杀死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've imagined killing you a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,上一次我们隔着15厘米的钢化玻璃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time, there was six inches of reinforced glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 持枪的 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- guns... -  No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.85,0:16:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,保镖围着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时没法杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't reach you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.85,0:16:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你不如先听听我的遗言啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna want to hear my last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-多姆 -不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dom! -  No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那你在杀了埃琳娜之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear Elena's last words
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,听过她的遗言吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before you killed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那你不觉得我是真的有很重要的事情才来找你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then don't you think I'd have a goddamn good reason to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.57,0:16:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是对你来说唯一重要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe the only reason that's ever mattered to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,小布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little B.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快醒醒 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.85,0:17:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有人来找麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an unwanted guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.78,0:17:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,按之前说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it that you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我今晚遇见了魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I met the devil tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直以为我才是魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, I always thought it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我也感觉挺失落的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that was kind of disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他直接找到了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came to my door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.14,0:17:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么闯了进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He let himself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:17:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,据说人在快死的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say when you're facing death,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.42,0:18:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,眼前会闪过人生的走马灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your life flashes before your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.11,0:18:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.91,0:18:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,先告诉我你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd start with who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人到死也不知道自己是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A question most can't answer in a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,给你3秒钟回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.85,0:18:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,趁你还没在沙发上把血流干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you bleed out on my couch,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.30,0:18:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你为什么来这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you might want to explain why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我来这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就是因为我敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of my enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我这人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a man with
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.83,0:18:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,无名也无姓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.90,0:18:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heir to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我来是为了我们共同的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm here for the same reasons you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.67,0:18:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,多米尼克·托雷多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你想杀多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to kill Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,想杀他的人多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Line's around the block.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.88,0:18:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,折磨远比杀死对方要更加残忍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never accept death when suffering is owed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.82,0:18:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你的工具和技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your toys and your tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All your boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.14,0:18:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不当我的盟友就只能当敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause you're either with me or you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我和别人一向合不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't play well with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那你只能看着你最爱的人死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you'll have to watch who you love most die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你面前就是我最爱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking at who I love most.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然妄想用我的招数来对付我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought you could use my own move against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我没在和你说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我这是在和奇克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was talking to Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.91,0:19:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,埃米尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.67,0:19:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还有凯文的爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁打来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.66,0:19:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cute kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都有在乎的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They all had something to take
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.67,0:19:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,除了这个可怜虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except that poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,连只猫都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even a kitty cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,各位可以做出选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of you have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.68,0:20:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,选我还是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me or...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要掌控世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to control the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而我想惩罚世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to punish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.15,0:20:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我会记住今天的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都会记住的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think everyone will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有人能帮我操作这个东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh. I need someone to help me operate this, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.09,0:20:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nerds?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我走好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,要还想见到家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you know what to do
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,知道该怎么做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you want to see your families again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ciao.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.55,0:20:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.83,0:20:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.63,0:20:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们以为我会信任你们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you think I would trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这年头想找到靠谱的帮手真难啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is hard finding good help these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,大战一触即发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a war coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.00,0:23:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候选择阵营了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sides are being chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.97,0:23:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你爱的每个人都会被毁掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And everyone you love will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.44,0:23:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,失血2.8升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost six pints of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.99,0:23:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,一般1.9升就致命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Normal person dies at four.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.55,0:23:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,正在把她送往秘密基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're shipping her back to our black site.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.13,0:23:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-有可能挺不过去 -她说的都是真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She may not make it. - But did her story check out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.76,0:23:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,市中心确实发生过枪击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We confirmed the shooting downtown,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,她的工具都不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but her tech wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.97,0:23:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,拿走它们的人等于拥有一个电子武器库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whoever took it now has an electronic arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.56,0:23:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-你提醒了你的人了吗 -米亚和布莱恩都很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've alerted your people? - Yeah, Mia and Brian are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.63,0:23:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我试过联系诺曼  特尔贾  拉姆齐还有韩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to get in touch with Roman, Tej, Ramsey, Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.70,0:23:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-但联系不上 -他们在哪你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No answer. - Any idea where they might be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.91,0:23:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.05,0:23:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,为你办事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.81,0:23:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆  我们没有  我们没发过罗马的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, we don't... we don't have a mission in Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.82,0:24:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.44,0:24:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.48,0:24:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-跟我来 -是的  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Follow me. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.00,0:24:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子  我会给你上完这套驾驶课的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son, you and I will finish that driving lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.32,0:24:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.22,0:24:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,无论发生什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.77,0:24:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定会信守承诺的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I always keep my promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.22,0:24:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,上楼去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.76,0:24:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,(罗马)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.86,0:24:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有人能跟我解释一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So can somebody please help me understand
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.97,0:24:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在我没法开车的情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how we're pulling off a mobile heist
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.28,0:24:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么才能开车抢劫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't even get to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.07,0:24:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们越快闯进卡车里偷走芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the sooner we break into the truck and steal the chip,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.08,0:24:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你就越快能够过上甜蜜生活  懂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sooner you get to live la dolce vita, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.60,0:24:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,罗曼  护送车队快到指定地点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roman, the convoy's almost in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.19,0:25:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell are you at?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.60,0:25:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是负责给我们打掩护吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be running interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.98,0:25:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,罗曼大人闪亮登场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romey-Rome's in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.54,0:25:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,都给我小心点 可别给我闪瞎了眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see me shining, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.09,0:25:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,都好好听我指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We on my mission now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.68,0:25:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当然知道这次是你来指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we all know that this is your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.92,0:25:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,因为除了你没有人会让韩开那辆古董小轿车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause nobody else on Earth would put Han in an Alfa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.06,0:25:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是罗曼非要开个带轮子的金库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we'd already be there if Roman wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.82,0:25:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在早就到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}driving Fort Knox on wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.41,0:25:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,知道引擎盖底下是什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what's under this hood, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.14,0:25:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这辆车超级炫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This car is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.69,0:25:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这辆老古董虽然马力不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What this old girl lacks in horsepower,
