Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.08,0:25:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.49,0:25:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然兰博基尼装有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While the Lamborghini has a V-10
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.49,0:25:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,威驰引擎和三阶段双涡轮增压套件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a Stage 3 UGR twin-turbo kit,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.25,0:25:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但你开的古董在这种环境中绝对有优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Alfa will definitely have an advantage in this environment.
