Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.19,0:25:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 你愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.20,0:25:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 就这么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all it took?
