Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.89,0:25:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,也无法联系上罗曼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you still can't reach Roman?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.69,0:25:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,电话电子邮件短信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No cell phone, emails or text messages.
