Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.41,0:26:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,已就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In position.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.61,0:26:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,让特尔佳小弟登场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cue Tiny Tej.
