Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.97,0:26:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你笑什么 别笑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you laughing at? Don't... -
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.25,0:26:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪弄的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd you even get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.04,0:26:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一句  特尔佳小弟的脑子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just so you know, Tiny Tej's brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.22,0:26:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,可比你灵光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still bigger than yours.
