Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.75,0:27:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们小心了 这不关“尼姑”的事（谐音梗扣钱）\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out, ladies. This ain't "nun" ya business!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.62,0:27:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,小心闪瞎眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to shine!
