Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.82,0:27:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被锁里面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're locked inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.06,0:27:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,方向盘正在被远程操控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truck's being steered remotely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.52,0:27:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一  二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a one, and a two, and a...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.71,0:28:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,吓我一跳  怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit! What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.75,0:28:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,炸药放多了  对吧  看好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put a little too much in, huh? Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.59,0:28:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,场面火爆啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.35,0:28:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scusi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.94,0:28:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那辆卡车被控制了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're stealing our truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.66,0:28:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还把我们关在了里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with us inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.15,0:28:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,刚收到报告布罗马广场发生了两起爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just got reports of two explosions near the Forum.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.02,0:28:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.40,0:28:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了？开始......\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready? And...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.99,0:28:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  听见了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.51,0:28:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是什么声音 -我也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell is that?! - I have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.03,0:28:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.96,0:28:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,车里有个巨型炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a big-ass bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.35,0:28:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么？-炸弹！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.11,0:28:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是说这辆车运送的是超级电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roman, you said this was carrying chips
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.21,0:28:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,芯片吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a supercomputer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.45,0:28:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是芯片是炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is not a chip. It's a bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.94,0:28:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,万一它爆炸了怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens if it goes off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.32,0:28:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫它万一爆炸了怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "What happens if it goes off?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.56,0:29:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,七丘城都会被炸成两半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Seven Hills of Rome will be down to two and a half!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.39,0:29:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,城市会化作废墟  无数人丧命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}City-wide devastation, countless lives lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.64,0:29:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道炸弹是干什么用的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the thing bombs do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.36,0:29:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去找你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're coming to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.65,0:29:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 呆子们 接下来炸什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, dorks. What are we blowing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.99,0:29:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.13,0:29:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,炸梵蒂冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Vatican?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.24,0:29:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧那就炸它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.65,0:29:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就等着下地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you guys are going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.69,0:29:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是那辆卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's their truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.87,0:29:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地多姆来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank God. Dom, Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.39,0:29:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 看看谁来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh. Look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.63,0:29:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,来的正好多米尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right on time, Dominic.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.77,0:29:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,断开加密无线电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn off the encrypted radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.39,0:29:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,拉姆齐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ramsey?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.81,0:29:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,卡车被远程操控了  车上有一个炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're being remote-controlled. There's a bomb on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.29,0:29:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一枚DM79型深海高档量冲刺地雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a DM-79 subnautical high-yield neutron mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.09,0:29:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.82,0:29:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可以用特工局的紧急关键装置拆除它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can disarm it with an agency kill switch.
