Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.06,0:29:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-必须拦下那辆卡车 -抱歉美国队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to stop that truck. - Sorry, Captain America.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.96,0:29:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不答应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't let you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.31,0:29:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,要抓紧了  卡车越来越快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to hurry! The truck is speeding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.01,0:30:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们必须拦住它 -我要开到车前面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got to block its path. - I'm gonna get ahead of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.63,0:30:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,拉姆齐  特尔佳坐稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ramsey, Tej, strap in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.79,0:30:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆  继续开我被堵住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, go ahead! I'm pinched!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.79,0:30:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,多米尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.11,0:30:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,让一让\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.73,0:30:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的真快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, he's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.91,0:30:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就这？晾衣绳？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? The clothesline?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.43,0:30:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,既然运不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we can't drive it,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.88,0:30:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那就干脆滚出来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}guess we're just gonna have to roll it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.04,0:31:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,情况不妙  马上要撞到斜坡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit! The truck's about to go over the hill!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.80,0:31:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们必须得撞上去 -你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to crash into it. - We have to what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.23,0:31:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的小金库我对不起你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry, my gold baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.58,0:31:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,停不下来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not stopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.93,0:31:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹滚出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, the bomb is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.76,0:31:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大家离炸弹远点  我来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, stay clear. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.24,0:31:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不  是我们来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:31:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,莱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.79,0:32:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他们变成恐怖分子了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have we made them all terrorists?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.24,0:32:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,已经把他们的照片传给当局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their images have been fed to the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.83,0:32:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好鲍勃  我要去干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Bob! I got to go kill that jerk
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.17,0:32:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那些想拆炸弹的混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's trying to disarm my bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.90,0:32:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,总有麻烦要处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's always something, you know? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.56,0:32:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们家人还在我手里别想乱跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, I still have your families, so don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.21,0:32:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,人特么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.77,0:32:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,早安 罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buongiorno, Roma!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.32,0:32:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.95,0:33:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.78,0:33:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  是你呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.23,0:33:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,风云人物  罗曼·皮尔斯大队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man of the hour. Roman Pearce, team leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.58,0:33:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要来找麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't wait to see you get out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.17,0:33:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  莱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Letty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.83,0:33:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现幕后黑手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I found our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.97,0:33:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  莱蒂  去你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Letty. Vaffanculo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.04,0:33:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我来对付他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.16,0:33:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,加油泵要爆炸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That pump's gonna blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.08,0:34:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,小无名氏  准备起飞吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little Nobody, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.33,0:34:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我现在就 - 喵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Moving to dis... - Peekaboo!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.10,0:35:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-赶快下车要爆炸了 -该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Get out of there! It's gonna blow! -Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.03,0:35:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-艺术就是爆炸！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.30,0:36:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得让他的引爆器失灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to jam the detonator now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.31,0:36:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了知道了,莱蒂你跟紧他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it, I got it. Letty, don't lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.59,0:36:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以锁定你的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can lock on to your location and transmit
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.59,0:36:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后通过你的手机传送干扰信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cellular interference through your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.35,0:36:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,应该能让引爆器失灵,争取点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should jam his detonator and buy us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.94,0:36:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,莱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.60,0:37:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.95,0:37:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有点麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting tricky, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.30,0:37:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就要跟不上那个人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't stay on him for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.16,0:37:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,拉姆齐,那条河有多深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ramsey, how deep is that river?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.06,0:37:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,台伯河吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Tiber? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.16,0:37:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大约18米深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, 60 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.61,0:37:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,河水能一定程度上缓冲爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, the water could smother the explosion,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.20,0:37:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,大概能弱化炸弹10成的威力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}reduce its power by ten times, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.58,0:37:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.39,0:37:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.50,0:37:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,差点就能抓到我了  宝贝儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed me by that much, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.78,0:37:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟丢了  让他跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost him. He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.44,0:37:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.96,0:37:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他跑出范围了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's out of our reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.10,0:37:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没法再干扰他的引爆器了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't jam the signal anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.58,0:37:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾  多姆  我还要继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad news, Dom. I'm back in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.66,0:38:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你还剩30秒来拯救罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got 30 seconds to save Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.05,0:38:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆他一旦引爆炸弹  你也会被炸进河里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, he armed the bomb, and you're almost at the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.02,0:38:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还剩15秒钟  多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}15 seconds, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.16,0:38:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆  听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.36,0:38:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,梵蒂冈在炸弹的爆炸范围里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Vatican's within the blast radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.88,0:38:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.30,0:38:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done everything you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.96,0:38:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还有办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.27,0:39:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,5\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.28,0:39:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,4\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.04,0:39:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,3\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.70,0:39:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.84,0:39:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,1\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.30,0:40:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都做了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.99,0:40:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,只有让你生不如死  我才能完成我的使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through your suffering, I'll fulfill my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.27,0:40:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,来找我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.65,0:40:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你的痛苦才刚开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your pain has just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.62,0:40:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,后会有期  多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you soon, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.31,0:40:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,据报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breaking news from Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.90,0:40:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,意大利首都罗马发生了大规模爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The capital Rome has been hit by a massive explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,意大利首都中心发生了一起可怕的爆炸事件
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,为致命炸弹发生爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.74,0:40:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,为巨型军事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be a large military weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.91,0:40:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,此次爆炸波及到了梵蒂冈宫殿
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.57,0:40:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,梵蒂冈的部分建筑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Vatican has sustained
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.60,0:40:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,遭到了破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some structural damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.71,0:40:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,目前没有造成人员死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but no lives were claimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.47,0:40:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,此次爆炸规模前所未有
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.81,0:40:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有关部门已查明涉案恐怖分子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Authorities have identified the terrorists as
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.47,0:40:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为以下5人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these five individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.58,0:40:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这5名恐怖分子是由该男子领队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as these five individuals, led by this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.23,0:40:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-多米尼克·托雷多 -托雷多 -托雷多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dominic Toretto. - Toretto. -Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.96,0:40:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-多米尼克·托雷多 -多米尼克·托雷多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dominic Toretto. - Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.83,0:40:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,执法部门正与多国相关部门合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Law enforcement is working across borders,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.45,0:40:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,开展有史以来规模最大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mobilizing an international fugitive hunt
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.62,0:40:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-跨国逮捕行动  -很抱歉长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- of unprecedented scale. -I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.00,0:40:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不知道她是怎么进来的  -我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know how she got in. - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.11,0:40:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我偷了你的证件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stole your badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.53,0:41:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,现在用完了  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done with it now, though. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.25,0:41:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是  呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if it isn't, um--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.87,0:41:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话  我不知道怎么称呼你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, I-I don't know what to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.50,0:41:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,叫你无名氏小姐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little Miss Nobody?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.33,0:41:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,直接叫我的名字怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you call me by my actual name?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.88,0:41:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,之前我听说  泰丝  你正在大马士革执行任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last I heard, Tess, you were running ops in Damascus.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.19,0:41:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为就凭你爸是传奇特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you can walk in this room
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.50,0:41:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就能这里想来就来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just 'cause your daddy's an agency legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.99,0:41:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我来这里是为了帮被告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here because someone needs to speak
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.68,0:41:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,说两句公道话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on behalf of the defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.30,0:41:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在罗马发生的爆炸事件无疑是一场灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What just happened in Rome was an unmitigated disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.72,0:41:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然伤亡被降到了最小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Casualties were kept to a minimum,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.41,0:41:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但却影响了世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the impact was global.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.76,0:41:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他们去罗马都干了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do you think happened in Italy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.34,0:41:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  我猜是看了风景  吃了意大利面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sightseeing, eating bucatini,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.69,0:41:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-还偷了一枚2万吨的炸弹 -得了吧  爱慕斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- stealing a 20-kiloton bomb. - Oh, come on, Aimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.73,0:41:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-你很清楚这是胡扯 -注意措辞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-That's bullshit and you know it. -Careful, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.32,0:41:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,现在小无名氏不能参与任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Little Nobody out of commission
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.98,0:41:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸又不知所踪  我才是这里的新老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your daddy in the wind, you're talking to the new boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.50,0:41:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.53,0:41:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,洛杉矶  2001年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Los Angeles, 2001.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.57,0:41:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,出身卑微  土生土长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humble roots, local kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.05,0:41:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,从街头赛车手变成抢劫犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}street racers who became hijackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.75,0:41:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,接着成为飞车走私犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Graduated to high-speed smuggling,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.34,0:41:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,驾车越狱抢劫火车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mobile jailbreaks, train robberies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.92,0:41:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,凡是能开车干的勾当  他们都干过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it could be done in a car, they did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.82,0:41:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,凡是违背常理和地球重力的  他们屡犯不止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it violates the laws of God and gravity, they did it twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.55,0:42:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这台词是你写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You write that yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.14,0:42:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次注意到他们是2011年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We first took notice in 2011,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.07,0:42:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在里约  他们抢劫了一个毒枭  埃尔奈勒耶斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rio, when they robbed a drug kingpin, Hernan Reyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.56,0:42:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,让他死在了一座桥上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}left his body on a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.53,0:42:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我的前辈  无名氏先生  看到了他们的潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My predecessor, Mr. Nobody, saw potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.12,0:42:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,于是把他们纳为了编外人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he recruited them-- freelance, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.50,0:42:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们帮我们在阿布扎比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They ran missions for us in Abu Dhabi,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.64,0:42:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,东京  伦敦  纽约  蒂比利斯执行过任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tokyo, London, New York, Tbilisi.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.43,0:42:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说  好几年前就该和他们撇清关系了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ask me, we should've cut ties years back,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.37,0:42:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但总有人支持他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they had their champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.02,0:42:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们用惯用伎俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's their M.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.47,0:42:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,笼络执法机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To corrupt law enforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.37,0:42:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱恩·奥康纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brian O'Conner.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.68,0:42:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜·内维斯 卢克·霍布斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elena Neves. Luke Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.58,0:42:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都变成了一家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone becomes family.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.48,0:42:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就像一帮爱车的极端分子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a cult with cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.41,0:42:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至你爸也成了一份子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even Tess's dear old dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.73,0:42:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们离堕落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're all just
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.01,0:42:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就差这一场烧烤派对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a barbecue and a beer away from corruption?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.59,0:42:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.87,0:42:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说他们是罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point is they're criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.42,0:42:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马出事并非偶然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rome was a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.19,0:42:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经偷走了几亿美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've stolen hundreds of millions of dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.88,0:42:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还有至少一艘核潜艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and at least one nuclear sub.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.19,0:42:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么能放任他们猖狂这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The real question is: How did we let this go on so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.92,0:42:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一家帮我们干了不少上不得台面的活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This family has gotten their hands dirty to keep ours clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.47,0:43:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经替特工局上过刀山下过火海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've driven to the gates of hell and back for this agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.30,0:43:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马爆炸案有问题很蹊跷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something is not right with Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.20,0:43:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能是他们做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.34,0:43:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也不蹊跷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can and it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.69,0:43:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是特工局该有的水平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The agency is better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.52,0:43:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不该这么容易上当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are smarter than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.97,0:43:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该支持多姆和他的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should be standing with Dom and his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.66,0:43:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们最应该做到的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the very least that we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.18,0:43:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不采取行动  我们所有人都会被波及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't act, this blows back on all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.97,0:43:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,后果会非常严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fallout will be existential.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.67,0:43:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请授予我全面行动权限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm asking for full green-light authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.95,0:43:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,动用一切手段杀掉或逮捕托雷多一伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill or capture the Toretto clan by any means.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.57,0:43:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,爱慕斯  你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aimes, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.30,0:43:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看来多数人赞成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like the ayes have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.30,0:43:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,作为你的直属上司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As your direct superior,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.10,0:43:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我一点也不在乎对方心地善不善良\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't give a shit about anybody's heart of gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.72,0:43:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我讨厌烧烤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I hate barbecues.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.66,0:43:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我强硬起来什么都做的出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I'd make a freight train take a dirt road,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.21,0:43:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,所以劝你别挡我的道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so do not get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.28,0:43:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.15,0:43:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我走我的道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.53,0:44:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马一沦陷  世界都乱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Rome falls, so does the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.18,0:44:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不像《罗马假日》那么美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it ain't no Roman holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.46,0:44:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不是电影男主角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're no Gregory Peck.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.23,0:44:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我的家人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.75,0:44:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我把他们藏起来  暂时安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your team's gone to ground. They're safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.51,0:44:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但莱蒂被抓住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've taken Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.37,0:44:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁干的 -特工局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's they? - The agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.58,0:44:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在是全世界特工组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you've just shot to number one
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.38,0:44:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,最想抓捕的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the world's most wanted list.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.04,0:44:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,陷害你的人想借此切断你和特工局的联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever did this wanted to sever your ties to the agency
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.52,0:44:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还想让你和家人分离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and isolate you from your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.42,0:45:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你联系家人通话一定会被追踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any attempt to contact your team will be traced.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.73,0:45:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,替我给无名氏先生捎一句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to get a message to Mr. Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.25,0:45:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那你得找个灵媒或者魔术师帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll need a medium for that or a magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.91,0:45:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在玩失踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's done his disappearing act.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.95,0:45:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,把话传出去就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get the message out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.57,0:45:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他我要去喝比利时啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him I'm ready to have that Belgian,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.78,0:45:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他就明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he'll know where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.06,0:45:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我说句心里话孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a message for you, ducky.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.75,0:45:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如今战火四处蔓延  你要是不顾自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world is on fire, and you want to keep running
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.06,0:45:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一个劲的往火海里冲去拯救别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the burning building to save lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.44,0:45:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你早晚会被大火吞噬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but eventually the building's gonna collapse on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.72,0:45:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不怕死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care about dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.59,0:45:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想尽力保护好所有我爱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only care about protecting the people that I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.80,0:45:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,知道为什么决斗士总是孤身一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why gladiators never had families?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.53,0:45:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-为什么 -因为他们知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Because they knew
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.63,0:45:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都可能是自己的末日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that every day might be their last.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.26,0:45:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你选择了一条孤独的路  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're choosing a lonely way, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.47,0:45:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能陪你走下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't take anyone with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.87,0:46:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,用天眼系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring God's Eye online.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.73,0:46:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命  启动中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Initiating.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.80,0:46:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,找到托雷多一伙的准确位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me Toretto and the others' locations
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.67,0:46:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要精确到毫米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the millimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.12,0:46:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,长官出问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.81,0:46:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,天眼跟踪硬件被移除了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The God's Eye tracking hardware has been removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.67,0:46:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是泰丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tess.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.36,0:46:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看来她来这不光是为了找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess her visit wasn't purely a social call.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.82,0:46:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我一个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.16,0:46:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦发现他的位置就追踪他的行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She pops up on any grid, let's see where she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.61,0:46:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,至于其他人我们已经掌握了嫌犯范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As for the rest, our fugitives aren't unknown quantities.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.58,0:46:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,托雷多有个妹妹  有个儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toretto has a sister, a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.28,0:46:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在找到他之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until we find him,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.59,0:46:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,先找他家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}find his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.89,0:47:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.40,0:47:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你又赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.34,0:47:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是跟你最爱的姑姑耍小聪明吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you cheating on-on your favorite auntie?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.00,0:47:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不管赢了一寸还是一米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter if you win by an inch or a mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.79,0:47:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了就是赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winning's winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.93,0:47:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这话听着有点耳熟啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have I heard that one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.25,0:47:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,跑快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.08,0:47:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-全面搜索 -要抓活的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Search everywhere! -We need them alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.40,0:47:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,趴地上别动  趴地上别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on the ground! Get on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.47,0:47:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不  米娅放开她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Mia! Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.72,0:47:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.71,0:48:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-你好吗？ -雅各布叔叔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's up? - Uncle Jakob?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.71,0:48:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸叫我来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your dad sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.51,0:48:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.43,0:48:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.84,0:48:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.61,0:49:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,小布在你那吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have Little B?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.85,0:49:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,小布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.96,0:49:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-别动！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.48,0:49:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-还好吗 -还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.49,0:49:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.43,0:49:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,小布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.53,0:49:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快来  快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.12,0:49:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人是谁派来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell were those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.13,0:49:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,特工局  去罗马是个陷阱  我们被算计了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agency. Rome was a trap. Whole family's being targeted.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.23,0:49:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去找布莱恩和其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I got to get to Brian and the kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.85,0:49:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆让我带走他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom sent me to take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.13,0:50:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,记得世界末日时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that place we said we'd go
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.10,0:50:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要去的地方吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if the world went to hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.34,0:50:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆让我们去那集合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom wants the team to meet there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.34,0:50:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.69,0:50:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.00,0:50:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,小布  你跟雅各布叔叔走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little B, you're gonna go with Uncle Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.42,0:50:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗？乖乖听他的话  乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? You do whatever he says. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.73,0:50:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我带你去找爸爸  如果你没意见的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get you to your dad. If that's okay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.35,0:50:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你要不惜生命保护他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protect him with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.01,0:50:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你  雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, Jakey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.95,0:50:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我也爱你  米娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, too, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.33,0:50:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,出发吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.41,0:50:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.31,0:50:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,呦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.97,0:50:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.80,0:50:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是这辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.66,0:50:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.53,0:50:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.10,0:51:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,(那不勒斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.59,0:51:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我想找个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.39,0:51:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,各位喝杯酒开心一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You boys look like you could use a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.81,0:51:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我来请客怎么样啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a round on me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.02,0:51:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我没骗你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.50,0:51:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我能请你们喝光这家店所有的酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will buy as many rounds as they can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.38,0:51:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是来这找人就没法活着出去了臭女人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.10,0:51:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,来一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shots? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.83,0:51:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,还是来一枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.94,0:52:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,啤酒  要两杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beers. Two of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.91,0:52:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.47,0:52:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.50,0:52:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,奎尼告诉我你在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie told me I could find you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.61,0:52:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,比利时啤酒？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Belgian?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.96,0:52:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,无名氏说过他有个女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Nobody said he had a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.17,0:52:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.24,0:52:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如今他不知去向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now that he's gone missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.14,0:52:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我来接他的班了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came in from the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.93,0:52:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸掌权时没人敢惹事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your dad kept the agency in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.80,0:52:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,现在好像牛鬼蛇神都跑出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it feels like all the anchors have been cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.25,0:52:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界没有规则  就没有安全可言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a world where there is no code, no one's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.63,0:52:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.56,0:52:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,特工局已经违背了它的原则和初衷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The agency has turned its back on everything it stood for.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.84,0:52:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,新任长官埃尔斯正在动用一切资源搜捕你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new boss, Aimes, he's coming for you with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.37,0:52:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我在帮你拖延时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm buying you some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.30,0:52:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,而且  还借用了他们的追踪小工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And borrowed their, uh, little tracking device thingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.72,0:52:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,眼熟吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.03,0:52:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-天眼 -嗯哼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-God's Eye. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.41,0:52:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我把它放保险柜里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd put that in a vault somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.10,0:52:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,保险柜会被从墙里拽出来  还是放我这安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People pull vaults out of walls, so I think it's safer with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.66,0:53:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我从他们看漏的交通录像里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pulled a screen grab
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.25,0:53:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,截了一张图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}off of a traffic cam that they missed,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.07,0:53:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,导入了天眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}put it in God's Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.77,0:53:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,显示人在里约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a hit in Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.42,0:53:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那不会刚好有敌人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't happen to have any enemies in Rio, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.22,0:53:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-雷耶斯 -埃尔南·雷耶斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Reyes. - Hernan Reyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.57,0:53:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,已经死透了  但是他有个儿子  但丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still pretty dead, but he has a son, Dante.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.33,0:53:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那你得送我去里约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're gonna have to get me to Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.30,0:53:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的第二个愿望  还剩一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your second wish. You have one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.61,0:53:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,莱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.93,0:53:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,她被关在秘密监狱里地图上都找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letty's in a black site prison off of every map.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.03,0:53:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那就救她出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then get her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.24,0:53:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody can.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.90,0:53:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,无名氏就能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody would.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.76,0:53:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆  我真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, I'm so sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.25,0:53:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这个愿望根本没办法实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what you're asking me to do is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.29,0:53:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一切皆有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.06,0:53:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只要相信你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just have to have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.73,0:54:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,把我藏在装满须后水的集装箱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sneaking us out of Rome in a shipping container
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.28,0:54:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,运出罗马真是个馊主义  罗曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}full of aftershave, that was a terrible idea, Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.56,0:54:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  我好像闻不到味道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, I think I lost my sense of smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.56,0:54:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这哪是须后水啊  这是催泪瓦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is not aftershave. That is tear gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.56,0:54:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,各位我没觉得有多难闻呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man, I don't know what y'all are talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.33,0:54:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你们懂我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.29,0:54:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在好香啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I smell magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.85,0:54:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我要顺手捎走一瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took a bottle for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.23,0:54:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,变成这样都要怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.92,0:54:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你清楚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.47,0:54:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别闹了你们只要乖乖听我这个“领队”的话就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, see, you just got to follow my "leat" as a "leater."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.96,0:54:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,懂吗  我天生就是做“领队”的料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see what I'm saying? I'm a natural-born "leater."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.79,0:54:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.55,0:54:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,带你回家了  拉姆齐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you back home, Ramsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.52,0:54:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的监控摄像头是全世界最多的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city with the most amount of surveillance cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.21,0:54:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这可真安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.43,0:54:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-我爸知道你开这种车吗 -当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad know you drive this thing? - He should.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.43,0:54:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我开着和他赛过车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I raced him in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.71,0:54:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但顺便告诉你在90年代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just so you know, in the '90s,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.50,0:55:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,能开5.0升引擎的车是很了不起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you were rolling in a 5.0, it meant you were the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.33,0:55:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这车可是福特野马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like it or not, it's still a 'Stang.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.02,0:55:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以稍微尊重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you know, respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.37,0:55:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.82,0:55:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听点旅行音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traveling music.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.21,0:55:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我13岁得到的这辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this car when I was 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.97,0:55:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,自己重新上了漆  还改造了发动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did the repaint myself. Rebuilt the motor, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.53,0:55:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哎对车的热爱有时是按捺不住的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah. Sometimes you just can't help what you love, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.25,0:55:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在到底要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna tell me where we're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.50,0:55:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的一个地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A place of mine your dad knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.54,0:55:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,去找你爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna meet him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.99,0:55:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.51,0:55:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会在那找到他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll meet him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.65,0:55:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要看你汗流如瀑布
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.35,0:55:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他以前是个内衣模特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy was an underwear model.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.11,0:55:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么？ -没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? -  Yeah. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.38,0:55:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go and...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.90,0:55:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,小布  身体扭回来  这是一个律动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little B, bring it back. It's a boomerang.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.46,0:55:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个律动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a boomerang, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.39,0:56:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 扭的不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.98,0:56:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,来享受它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's feeling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.29,0:56:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这才叫享受节奏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's called feeling the vibrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.95,0:56:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这歌真过瘾  这活力！这节奏！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just energy, man. It's energy. It's vibrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.26,0:56:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,享受！享受！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel it! Feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.66,0:56:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,(特工局秘密基地)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.72,0:56:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可以进了  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're clear, Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.45,0:56:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,高档外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fancy coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.35,0:56:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,亮晶晶的耳环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expensive earrings.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.46,0:56:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这鞋穿着很疼吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those got to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.80,0:56:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你是特工局的重要人物吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really brought out the big guns, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.05,0:56:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是代表他们来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not here for the agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.09,0:56:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能是你没收的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've confiscated that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.29,0:56:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你左腕那条伤疤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That scar on your left wrist,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.37,0:56:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是认识多姆的第一晚留下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you got it the night you met Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.47,0:56:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他说当时在炫耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he was showing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.27,0:56:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我在收音器上安了超声波干扰器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put an ultrasonic jammer on the audio,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.41,0:56:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但摄像头还是能拍到我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the cameras can still see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.58,0:56:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  我会带你离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm gonna get you out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.20,0:56:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但我需要些时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's gonna take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.38,0:56:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我没时间等了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is what I don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.07,0:57:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我得赶快回到多姆身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to get back to Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.45,0:57:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我在牢里什么忙也帮不上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no good to anyone in this cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.56,0:57:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我有预感你肯定是做好了准备才来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a feeling you didn't come all this way without a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.28,0:57:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,强者能看透彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game recognizes game.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.01,0:57:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦我开了弓  就没有回头箭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I make this move, there's no coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.57,0:57:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,听着合我心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.98,0:57:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  首先我带你离开牢房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. First, let's get you out of this cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.09,0:57:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-会有点疼 -嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's gonna hurt. - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.61,0:57:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,配合一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.37,0:57:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,打开门！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.58,0:57:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,放倒她！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.58,0:57:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,守卫  守卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guards! Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.65,0:57:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-救命 -放开她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-  Help! - Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.07,0:57:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,放开她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.24,0:57:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你来真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.20,0:58:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真没想到啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Que surpresa!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.45,0:58:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.65,0:58:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我能走到这儿多亏了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of this happens without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.52,0:58:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 很高兴见到你  哥们儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home. Good to see you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.45,0:58:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,迪奥戈  我也很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diogo, good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.56,0:58:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,车不错嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah. Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.45,0:58:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对了我听说你被盯上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, uh, I hear you got a little heat on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.80,0:58:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  我是来找人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, I'm just looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.04,0:58:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么能帮你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can we help?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.32,0:58:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,老大他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.33,0:58:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经帮上忙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.74,0:59:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.79,0:59:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.34,0:59:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.05,0:59:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,别让我哭鼻子  让一让
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.59,0:59:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.88,0:59:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,给你介绍个人 他是个人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to meet somebody. A GOAT.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.86,0:59:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,活着的传奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A living legend, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.43,0:59:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.01,0:59:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,很难不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.52,0:59:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你今晚肯定稳操胜券了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be in the winner's circle tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.56,0:59:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你在车上安装了RB26引擎对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you put in a RB26 in that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.74,0:59:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,2.4升的承受不住这么强的升压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}L24 would never handle this much boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.60,0:59:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我的兄弟们也会认可的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My boy back home would approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.05,0:59:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎别人认不认可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not looking for anyone's approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.64,0:59:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你先别急着否认  看看你的周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you get ahead of yourself, look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.47,0:59:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,大家或多或少都在寻求认可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all looking for a little validation.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.37,0:59:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-你要和我赛车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You racing or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.82,0:59:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我劝你最好别和他起冲突\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, you don't want that smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.13,0:59:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我今晚来不是为了赢别人的车的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not here for pink slips tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.62,0:59:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.79,0:59:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我当场就能击败他
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.17,0:59:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的人都这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.29,1:00:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.81,1:00:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谁打败了我就能赢得一百万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A million dollars for whoever can beat me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.50,1:00:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,迪奥戈  拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diogo, here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.13,1:00:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.30,1:00:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莎贝尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isabel.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.92,1:00:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.07,1:00:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.51,1:00:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚有场比赛  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be a race tonight, yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.27,1:00:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,应该有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.65,1:00:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-靓女拜托啦  加我一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pretty please, with me on top.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.00,1:00:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,多米尼克·托雷托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.59,1:00:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you would come for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.87,1:00:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾当时没有在罗马见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry we didn't get to meet in Roma.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.11,1:00:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩太忙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were both so busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.32,1:00:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是但丁 你好呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Dante. Enchanté.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.26,1:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你当时真是战神下凡  英勇无畏  帅呆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you were fantástico, fabuloso, o cara.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.50,1:00:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他拯救了梵蒂冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saved the Vatican.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.43,1:00:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁能办到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who does that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.64,1:00:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,教皇  还是上帝？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously. The Pope? God?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.92,1:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对了  你看到那场好戏了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, did you see what I did there?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.79,1:00:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是在还原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ball through the city was
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.68,1:00:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们家保险箱的遭遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a bit of an homage to my family's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.38,1:00:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还加了火焰特效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except it was on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.35,1:01:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得我爸吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember my father?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.59,1:01:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-埃尔南·雷耶斯 -是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hernan Reyes. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.18,1:01:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他以为自己能一手遮天  称霸一方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember he thought he had his foot on this city's neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.53,1:01:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但你猜怎么着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.08,1:01:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我打败了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.19,1:01:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们别当着大家的面吵架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not argue in front of the children.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.71,1:01:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的一点也没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.43,1:01:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸是个大恶人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was a horrible man,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.09,1:01:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,失败的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}very bad daddy,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.58,1:01:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还挺喜欢他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I kind of liked him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.37,1:01:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可你不仅抢了我们的钱  还害了我没了爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you took him from me when you stole our money
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.10,1:01:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,让我每天活在痛苦里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and left us with nothing but suffering.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.65,1:01:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我来这就是为了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's what I came here for.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.66,1:01:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,帮你从痛苦里解脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To end that suffering.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.66,1:01:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  还有  我没抢你们家钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and I didn't take that money.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.35,1:01:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I burned it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.80,1:01:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.63,1:01:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  巴西由我说了算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Brazil is mine,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.60,1:01:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是我的地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I own this city.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.37,1:02:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为有钱就什么都能买到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You people think you can buy everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.89,1:02:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但你买不来街头人的尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can't buy the streets.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.97,1:02:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们与多姆在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stand with Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.56,1:02:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这下就尴尬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this is awkward.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.32,1:02:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不如我们同时开枪朝对方乱射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how about we all just start shooting each other
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.60,1:02:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看谁死谁活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and see what happens?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.60,1:02:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,或者赛车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or we race.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.57,1:02:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你赢了就送我坐牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you win, you take me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.50,1:02:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you lose...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.68,1:02:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,最好别输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.78,1:02:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,聚到这的人都是为了看赛车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all came 'cause you wanted to see a race.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.17,1:02:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那就放马过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's race!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.30,1:03:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  真辣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.48,1:03:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,穿黑衣服开黑车真酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black on black look good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.83,1:03:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在好奇什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you're thinking,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.31,1:03:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  我下面的毛和头发都是一个颜色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, yes, the carpet matches the drapes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.45,1:03:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,拉到吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.08,1:03:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我竟然要和伟大的多米尼克·托雷多赛车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe I'm gonna race the great Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.29,1:03:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,人家好激动啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have butterflies.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.12,1:03:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是太厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just so impressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.85,1:03:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了那么多比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've won so many races.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.78,1:03:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,赢得了所有人的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone loves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.20,1:03:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,还救了那么多条命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've saved so many lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.85,1:03:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.68,1:03:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你就像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like you're a...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.06,1:03:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大圣人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a saint.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.17,1:03:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,多米尼克大圣人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saint Dominic.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.79,1:03:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在研究你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've been studying you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.94,1:03:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在观察你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And watching you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.63,1:04:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但我猜不出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.08,1:04:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.63,1:04:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你会怎么选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you choose?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.88,1:04:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你会选择去救谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you choose the ones you save?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.53,1:04:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheguei.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.71,1:04:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是里约宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.71,1:04:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,各就各位
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.55,1:04:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,出发！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.57,1:05:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.58,1:05:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就要赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm beating you, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.83,1:05:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你太心急了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too eager.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.28,1:05:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个感觉才够劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.36,1:05:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,噢  别别 别开那么快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no. You shouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.87,1:06:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,该我了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.06,1:06:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,多米尼克  你要救谁呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic, who will you choose?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.07,1:06:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你要救谁呢  多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you gonna choose, Dom?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.83,1:06:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是救那女的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna save her?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.11,1:06:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-还是救你兄弟 -太刺激了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Or are you gonna save him? - Let's go, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.11,1:06:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,老子赢定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This race is mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.08,1:06:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,点兵点将点到谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eeny, meeny, miny...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.06,1:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.26,1:06:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你选好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you made your choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.64,1:06:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,胜利属于我！喔！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally! Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.33,1:06:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别走  迪奥戈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, Diogo!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.20,1:06:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚是陷阱题  他们都得死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trick question. Everyone dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.96,1:06:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,123\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.18,1:06:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,艺术就是爆炸！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.05,1:06:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.71,1:07:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.99,1:07:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我赢了比赛  哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I win, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.16,1:07:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,再来找我  多米尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep coming, Dom!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.75,1:07:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,以后的好戏还多着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so much more fun to be had!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.89,1:07:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.94,1:08:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好！亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.05,1:08:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.57,1:08:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那男的“嘭”一声被炸飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then he was like, "Boom!"
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.37,1:08:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我就“巴拉”一声被震到了 那女的就被惊道“什么鬼”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I was like, "Blam!" And she was like, "What?"
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.33,1:08:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说“闭嘴吧”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was like, "Shut up."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.16,1:08:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,结果我成了世界第一的赛车手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I'm the best racer in the world, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.89,1:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰指甲  等它晾干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not touch that. Let it dry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.83,1:08:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看着气色不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys look fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.17,1:08:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道黑色比较显瘦看起来有威慑力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the black is very slimming and very scary,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.69,1:08:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在其实流行粉彩色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the pastels, you know, they're in season,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.56,1:08:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,粉色能弱化一点阳刚之气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I feel like it tones down the masculinity a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.53,1:08:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,五大三粗的男人太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which we all need these days.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.67,1:08:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.08,1:08:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,认真听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.67,1:08:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗  在法律意义上我当时死了2分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know that I was legally dead for two minutes?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.16,1:08:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,2分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.50,1:08:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍勃  别走神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob, pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.78,1:08:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,猜我看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know what I saw?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.85,1:08:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,空白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.09,1:08:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,完全一片空白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a goddamn thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.41,1:09:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但我确实感觉在他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do feel like once he, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.65,1:09:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,撞裂我的脑壳后我想开了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cracked my skull open, it just opened my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.42,1:09:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,意义深刻对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's deep, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.45,1:09:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的很对  鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're absolutely right, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.80,1:09:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,该继续干正事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.80,1:09:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个工作狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a stickler.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.25,1:09:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.  Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.57,1:09:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们的钱都划走怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we take all their money?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.88,1:09:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你你个小坏蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. You are evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.43,1:09:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢两位当听众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.26,1:09:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那么  把这里当自己的家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, mi casa, su casa.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.06,1:09:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,晾干指甲油  喝完鸡尾酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let these dry, finish those mojitos,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.23,1:09:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,然后很快就会有人来安葬你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, um, someone's gonna come and bury you guys soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.72,1:09:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去洗我的秀发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go wash my hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.23,1:10:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.71,1:10:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.27,1:10:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.93,1:10:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好酷 这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.14,1:10:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个技术工具包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a technical tool kit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.49,1:10:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心  都是一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, it's just a bunch of awesome stuff
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.28,1:10:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远用不着的炫酷工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you're never gonna get to use.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.18,1:10:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.73,1:10:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,睁大眼睛  别乱动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes open. Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.91,1:10:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,别笑这么夸张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't smile like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.29,1:10:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,怪吓人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's unsettling.
