Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.67,1:19:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿  迷幻马芬蛋糕我请客 -你想怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, fun muffins on me, okay? - What? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.91,1:19:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.98,1:19:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我活该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I deserved that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.19,1:19:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-你还好吧 -还好  谢谢你  老哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay, bro? - Yeah, thank you, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.13,1:19:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  现在该去哪呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, so where to now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.82,1:19:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jail?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.10,1:19:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道一个地方  一个我很不想去的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know somewhere. Last place I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.99,1:20:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,和我站在一边感觉如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does it feel to be on my side of the law?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.78,1:20:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,特工局喜欢先修好东西再破坏掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They like to fix things before they break 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.65,1:20:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方让人恶心  莱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a sick place, Letty.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.48,1:20:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.17,1:20:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.52,1:20:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我修改了麻醉气体的输送通道  输送到了他们的空调里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I rerouted anesthetic gas into their air conditioning.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.62,1:20:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,再过几分钟那些摄像头就会恢复正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I bought us a few minutes before these cameras reset
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.11,1:20:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就会发现这里已经变成了睡眠研究所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they find out this place turned into a sleep study.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.26,1:20:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你是要继续生闷气  还是想要离开这里呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna stay grumpy or do you want to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.50,1:20:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可不会永远睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not gonna sleep forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.95,1:20:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想回到你宝贵的家人身边吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you want to get back to your precious family?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.06,1:21:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.75,1:21:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来你都搞定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems like you got this covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.72,1:21:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-你要我帮你做什么 -我有个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you need me for? - I have a plan,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.52,1:21:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但需要2个人才能完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's a two-person job.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.94,1:21:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,很简单吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, was that so hard?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.50,1:21:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有多少时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much time do we have?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.60,1:21:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,大概4分钟吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say about four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.71,1:21:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那应该够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll have to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.93,1:21:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是你就不会站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd stay down if I was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.31,1:21:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那你还得再加把劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to hit me harder for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.00,1:21:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你会后悔这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna regret this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.88,1:23:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但丁·雷耶斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dante Reyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.16,1:23:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,出生于葡萄牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born in Portugal.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.03,1:23:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲出生于太平洋诸岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother from the Pacific Islands.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.00,1:23:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,孩提时代他就展现了反社会倾向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sociopathic tendencies from an early age.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.00,1:23:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,很快他从少管所到了监狱  再到了精神病院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He bounced from juvie to prison to mental wards.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.14,1:23:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,每一次他父亲都会来保释他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And each time, Daddy was there to spring him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.52,1:23:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他父亲去世后他就消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After his father died, he disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.25,1:23:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,雷耶斯生前拥有的一切不动产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Properties Reyes owned before he died.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.88,1:23:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如今都被出售或者收回了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now all sold and repo'd.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.50,1:23:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,除了这一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.67,1:23:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,警察局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The police station.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.85,1:23:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,已经荒废了很多年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been abandoned for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.09,1:23:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜产权证上是谁的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And guess whose name is on the deed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.92,1:23:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但丁·雷耶斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dante Reyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.62,1:23:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我会在那找到答案的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find my answer there.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.76,1:24:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.21,1:24:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望你再出任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.46,1:24:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我本可以赢下那场比赛的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have won that race, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.02,1:24:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你想重赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you want a rematch?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.40,1:24:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我要求必须重赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm demanding it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.92,1:24:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那好那就稍后见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I guess I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.54,1:24:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.46,1:24:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,疯子被困在市中心贫民窟了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.67,1:24:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们  最好别这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, you don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.82,1:25:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他要一块新手表  警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs a new watch, cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.02,1:25:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 手表是别人送我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, the watch was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.54,1:25:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的护裆里有16克拉未切割的钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I got 16 carats of uncut diamonds in my jockstrap
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.10,1:25:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you want to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.90,1:25:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这下你是需要换换新的表了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you really do need a new watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.05,1:25:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.54,1:25:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,小布 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.68,1:25:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,来口香糖  会好受点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tried gum? Gum helps.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.17,1:25:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我一点也不喜欢坐飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like planes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.52,1:25:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是因为恐高  那确实是个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's the height, that's gonna be an issue.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.38,1:25:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗  我曾经很怕车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I used to be scared of cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.76,1:25:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲死后  我常常责备自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After my dad died, I guess I blamed myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.63,1:25:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,当时很难受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.67,1:25:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,患过惊恐发作之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had panic attacks, the whole bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.19,1:25:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时只敢坐公交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heck, I took the bus.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.70,1:26:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对  我当时很担心自己会犯错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I think I was just so worried about making mistakes
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.60,1:26:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怕我不会像我哥哥一样优秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not being as good as my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.81,1:26:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-你呢 -拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You? - Uh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.26,1:26:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你爸爸什么样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you met your dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.09,1:26:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我时常活在他的阴影下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He casts a pretty big shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.96,1:26:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  好些了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh. Feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.69,1:26:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.83,1:26:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.69,1:26:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是您点的饮料  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the drink that you ordered, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.87,1:26:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know her?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.70,1:26:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 人都得有点高端朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's good to have friends in high places.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.84,1:26:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,数到3\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the count of three,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.57,1:26:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们站起来去厕所  准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna get up and go to the bathroom. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.19,1:26:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,3\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.33,1:27:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人是谁呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who were those guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.75,1:27:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,特工局的  他们发现我们了  我们得甩掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agency. They found us. Now let's lose our tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.83,1:27:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我勒个去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shi...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.69,1:27:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,打住  只有在歌词里  或者磕到脚趾的时候才可以骂脏话啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Swearing is for song lyrics only and stubbed toes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.14,1:27:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,算了  集中注意力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about it. Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.56,1:27:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这里太高了  我们没法滑翔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? We're-we're too high to glide,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.98,1:27:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,只能俯冲  也就是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we need thrust, which means, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.19,1:27:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 燃烧也就是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}combustion, which means...?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.64,1:27:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,氧气和燃料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oxygen and fuel.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.26,1:27:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,酒精\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.24,1:28:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那是桃红葡萄酒  没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's rosé. Not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.65,1:28:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,很难解释  但主动性很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long story. But good initiative.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.25,1:28:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你不恐高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad it wasn't the height.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.22,1:28:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,享受下降之旅吧  小布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy the ride, Little B.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.41,1:28:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍伊标记了我们的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bowie tagged us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.10,1:28:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,特工局正在追赶我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The agency is on our tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.38,1:28:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须找到装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find gear
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.76,1:28:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,尽快到集合点那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get to the rendezvous as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.93,1:28:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.07,1:28:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你们原地待命  这里就交给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys hold back. Let me take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.45,1:28:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 这可不是好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Th-That's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.66,1:28:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-跟罗马任务一样差劲 -什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I mean like Roman-level bad. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.35,1:28:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么呀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.42,1:28:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到我说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard what I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.87,1:28:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,听着兄弟你用不着这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, bro, you don't have to do this, man.
