Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.56,1:29:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,死人会出现在我门前只有一个原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only reason a dead guy shows up at my door:
