Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.40,1:29:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-该死 -干 韩！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, shit. - Shit. Han!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.13,1:29:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该活过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should have stayed dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.27,1:29:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以  我能进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can get in. I can get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.03,1:29:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢重复自己的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like repeating myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.55,1:29:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你糟蹋了我的零食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ruined my snacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.42,1:29:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静  我不想和你打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. I don't want to fight you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.70,1:29:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那就速战速决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then this is gonna end quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.08,1:30:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你带了一堆人来杀我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bring more men to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.43,1:30:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也想杀掉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're trying to kill me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.08,1:30:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看来还有更多的朋友在找我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it looks like we got more company.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.54,1:30:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-你还会开车吗 -你说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You still drive? - What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.40,1:30:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  再给我点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.58,1:30:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别动！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.15,1:31:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-放下笔记本电脑 -好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Drop the laptop! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.18,1:31:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们  我进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.33,1:31:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.06,1:31:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们扯平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we're even.
