Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.88,1:32:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  这些我都能理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, see, I understand all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.61,1:32:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但刚才那是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.24,1:32:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-你刚被吓到了  -我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-You got scared. -I saw that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.00,1:32:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-我才没被吓到兄弟 -没错他被吓傻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ain't nobody got scared, bruh. - No, you were... he was scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.60,1:32:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有人来找麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an unwanted guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.77,1:32:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的家人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.95,1:32:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.60,1:32:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来没害怕过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.71,1:32:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不怕死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care about dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.30,1:33:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想尽力保护好所有我爱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only care about protecting the people that I love.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.40,1:33:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们牢牢记在心里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold us in your heart
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.58,1:33:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你就永远不会迷路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you will never lose your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.16,1:33:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来没害怕过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.58,1:33:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧就是最好的老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear can be a great teacher.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.17,1:33:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来没害怕过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.08,1:33:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢我那个地方吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you like my place?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.88,1:33:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜我不在那里  没法带你逛逛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm bummed I'm not there to show you around.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.26,1:33:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一想到你看到了我  就有点尴尬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a little embarrassed you saw my vision board.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.12,1:33:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈但至少你知道了  为了此时此刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But at least you know how hard I've been working
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.09,1:33:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我有多努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get us to this point.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.44,1:33:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道你死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I know you're a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.20,1:33:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是复活过的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean resurrected.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.51,1:33:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我要感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.17,1:33:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你开车拽走那个保险箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if you never would have gotten behind that wheel,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.89,1:33:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远不会变成今天这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd never be the man that I am today.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.76,1:33:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你的生活是如此的美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You built such a beautiful life,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.79,1:33:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,佳人相伴充满爱意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}filled with love and family.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.83,1:33:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说遥不可及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never got that chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.59,1:33:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,意外  混乱  死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Collateral damage, chaos, death.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.56,1:33:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,会使你变成一个传奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your legacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.05,1:33:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而我会让你青史留名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your legacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.39,1:34:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道有一点我始终不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I can't figure out?
