Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.68,1:34:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一个畜生是得不到尊重的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got no honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.51,1:34:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没有尊重  你也得不到家人的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without honor, you got no family.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.48,1:34:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,失去所有家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And without family...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.41,1:34:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,将一无所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you've got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.45,1:34:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你我才一无所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have nothing because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.42,1:34:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的未来  我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My future. My family.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.87,1:34:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,都被你偷走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stole that from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.56,1:34:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我要一点一点的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I'm gonna break yours,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.32,1:34:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,毁掉你的家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}piece by piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.91,1:34:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你少说废话  有本事站出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop talking and face me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.39,1:34:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢惊喜吗？多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like surprises, Dommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.84,1:34:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈  我非常喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I adore them.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.37,1:34:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏还没结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the game's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.88,1:34:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人还等着我去伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's still so many people to hurt.
