Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.86,1:34:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你戴着手铐可不好抓我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's gonna be hard to do in handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.20,1:34:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  再见  多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, bye, Dommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.38,1:34:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你先挂断吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you hang up first.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.28,1:34:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.77,1:35:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,托雷多  别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toretto, freeze.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.01,1:35:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,该面对现实了  多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to face the music, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.81,1:35:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,警官你这么做就让他得逞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're playing right into his hands, cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.09,1:35:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,远离交通工具
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.34,1:35:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,1组准备集合
