Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.16,1:35:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.79,1:36:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.63,1:36:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.10,1:36:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.80,1:36:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just great.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.12,1:36:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,狗屎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.54,1:36:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很冷吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little chilly?
