Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.82,1:36:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不过至少你会暖和一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe, but at least you'll be warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.62,1:36:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,“谢谢你,西佩尔,谢谢”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Thank you, Cipher. Thank you."
