Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.74,1:37:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你可千万别忘了找他要收据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure you get a receipt from him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.51,1:37:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要忘了要收据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.85,1:37:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍伊也不是百无一用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess Bowie
