Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.65,1:37:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪被但丁转走的款项\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to complete our trace of Dante.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.06,1:37:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,截止目前他让所有人都进了坑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been ten moves ahead of us this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.58,1:37:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他一个人是怎么办到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does he do it by himself?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.03,1:37:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哎  这可不太妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, this isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.72,1:37:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的钱被转去了全世界各地的账户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our money, it's been split into accounts all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.07,1:37:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这些账户都在谁的名下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And look who they're registered to.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.25,1:37:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是雇佣兵杀手团的人  一群真正的人渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are mercenary kill teams. Real scum.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.94,1:37:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他用我们的钱收买了一支军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used our money to buy an army.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.77,1:37:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙不仅想干掉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this guy doesn't just want us dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.77,1:37:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还想让我们彻底消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to erase us off the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.08,1:37:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他想让我们内斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to tear us apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.57,1:37:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,正是因为这样  我们才需要去集合点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly why we need to link back up with Dom
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.64,1:37:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,和多姆会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.06,1:37:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你来看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.71,1:37:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不仅会追杀我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've been paid to target us
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.37,1:37:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还会追杀帮助过我们的所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and anyone who ever helped us until now.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.78,1:38:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,交通工具包在我身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have transport waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.96,1:38:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那那你要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.20,1:38:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我要送他们进坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna dig some graves.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.76,1:38:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,无名氏的得力手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Nobody's golden boy,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.39,1:38:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还没抵抗就乖乖就犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}caught without so much as a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.56,1:38:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这太无趣了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.22,1:38:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这就像大老远跑去珠穆朗玛峰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like going all the way to Everest
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.08,1:38:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,去选择坐电梯  哈哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and taking the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.57,1:38:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好系紧安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might want to buckle up.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.98,1:38:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你为特工局做了不少好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you did some good work for the agency.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.16,1:38:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你觉得自己能因此被宽大处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you figured that buys you some leniency.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.02,1:38:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可时代变了  大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's a new day.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.09,1:38:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来  现在都没人愿意听话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the problem nowadays. Nobody listens.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.83,1:38:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你该少花点时间研究车子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have spent less time with your head under the hood
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.48,1:39:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,多花点时间为即将到来的事做准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and more time preparing for what's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.90,1:39:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,间谍已被人造卫星替代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spies have been replaced by satellites,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.42,1:39:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗机飞行员被无人机替代  情报局被算法替代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fighter pilots by drones, intelligence by an algorithm.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.36,1:39:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,坐在方向盘后面就能改变世界的日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The days where one man behind the wheel of a car
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.12,1:39:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,已经结束了  多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can make a difference are over, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.98,1:39:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,应该说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, the days of any man
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.78,1:39:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这年头谁坐在方向盘后面都不能改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}behind the wheel of a car are over.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.99,1:39:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.06,1:39:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,做好准备  要出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preparing for what's to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.68,1:39:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.46,1:39:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.37,1:40:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就在前面交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.78,1:40:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,多米尼克  我带你回到了我们初见的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic, I brought you back to where we first met.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.86,1:40:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你准备了一个惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.03,1:40:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.48,1:40:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在听你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm listening now.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.62,1:41:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,多米尼克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.83,1:41:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,多米尼克！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.14,1:41:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你能别再伤害我的新朋友了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you stop hurting my new friends?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.00,1:41:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我来这只是为了伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm only here to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.66,1:41:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,和你说实话吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.22,1:41:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才做的车子特技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That little car stunt you just did?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.87,1:41:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was pretty awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.94,1:41:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.19,1:41:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,开的好酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was so cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.53,1:41:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你要不停手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you don't stop,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.74,1:41:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我就割她身上的肉  每一个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna cut her everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.85,1:41:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,使劲割\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Badly.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.72,1:41:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  她在这里呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.34,1:41:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-哼 -故意晚登场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hmm. - Fashionably late.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.76,1:41:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.04,1:41:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,过去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.90,1:41:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.15,1:42:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,能从我的车上下来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you please get off my car?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.77,1:42:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太不尊重人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is so disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.60,1:42:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你话可真多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talk too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.21,1:42:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,停下  停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.38,1:42:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,知不知道你的力气有多大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know your own strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.80,1:42:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你混蛋！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You butthole!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.32,1:42:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.70,1:42:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢芭蕾吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like ballet?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.70,1:42:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢《天鹅湖》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I adore Swan Lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.32,1:42:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉你像是会喜欢《胡桃夹子》的人哎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like you're more of a-- kind of a Nutcracker guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.22,1:42:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,1  2......\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a one, and a two, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.12,1:42:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.87,1:42:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.96,1:42:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.10,1:42:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.66,1:43:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她有危险  你会怎么做呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's in peril. What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.42,1:43:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你的问题是什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what your problem is?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.90,1:43:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.74,1:43:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你拯救不了所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't save 'em all.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.67,1:43:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,5  4\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five. Four.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.57,1:43:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗒嗒嗒嗒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah-ta-ta-ta-ta.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.92,1:43:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快点哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.43,1:43:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.76,1:43:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不喜欢芭蕾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't like ballet.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.55,1:43:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.24,1:43:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,能把天眼给我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I please have the God's Eye?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.21,1:43:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-别做梦了 -不行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Screw you. - No?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.83,1:43:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,靓女求求你了哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.32,1:43:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.73,1:43:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,到手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh. Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.91,1:43:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,交易愉快  车送你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good trade. Keep the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.15,1:43:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,哎  小多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Dommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.23,1:43:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说过  我要让你生不如死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, you owe me suffering!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.26,1:43:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,能让你青史留名的不是金钱和权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your legacy isn't money or power
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.78,1:44:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是组建的家庭和人生的过往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the family you built or the life you led.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.27,1:44:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,而是你生命的延续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the life you made.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.41,1:44:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,父子之情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a father and his son...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.90,1:44:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,高于一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.21,1:44:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这座桥上杀了我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed my father on this bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.31,1:44:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我知道去哪里找你儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I know where to find your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.91,1:44:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,幸会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enchanté.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.43,1:44:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会有事的  泰丝  伤口被贯穿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be okay, Tess. It went clear through.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.82,1:44:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有点疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kinda hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.23,1:44:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲会以你为荣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father would be proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.30,1:44:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.31,1:44:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.14,1:44:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,相信自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.18,1:44:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她需要去医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She needs a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.97,1:45:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.97,1:45:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,把她交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got her.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.45,1:45:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,去救你的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go save your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.32,1:45:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我的外甥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My nephew.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.57,1:45:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会向你道歉  但我会帮你一个大忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna say I'm sorry, so let me do you one better.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.37,1:45:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去接你儿子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.92,1:45:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,(葡萄牙)
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.75,1:46:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这里原来是座老矿山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, it used to be an old mine,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.06,1:46:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在大山深处炸出了隧道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they blasted tunnels deep into the mountain.
