Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.59,1:46:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须相信自己能变废为宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just got to keep yourself open to possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.93,1:46:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,而且当然还要有足够的空闲时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, of course,  have a lot of time on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.32,1:46:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过我们会在这里见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said we'd meet him here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.98,1:46:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.84,1:46:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你了解你爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know your dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.60,1:46:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他会安全过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got to make it safe.
