Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.13,1:46:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你  雅各布叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, Uncle Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.90,1:47:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.97,1:47:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那个嘛啊  是我一直在忙的一个项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That? Ah, project I've been working on.
