Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.50,1:47:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在进入葡萄牙领空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we're entering Portuguese airspace.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.95,1:47:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布已经到了  多姆有消息吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jakob's already there. Any word from Dom?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.89,1:47:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.75,1:47:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么这么安静  咋了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you so quiet? You all right?
