Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.90,1:47:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,特尔佳  那是我的任务  都在听我指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tej, it was my mission, y'all took my lead,
