Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.67,1:47:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本就不适合带领你们做事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leadership thing really ain't for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.81,1:47:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你用集装箱把我们运到了伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took us to London on a container.
