Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.54,1:48:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,此刻你还坐在这里独自担下全责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're sitting here taking sole responsibility
