Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.75,1:48:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜我听完这话想到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what it sounds like to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.27,1:48:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,也就领队会说这话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds like a leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.70,1:48:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,行了  兄弟快站起来吧  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man. Get your ass up, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.29,1:48:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你  哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, man.
