Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.64,1:54:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.92,1:54:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,一起来点刺激的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You party? I party.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.99,1:54:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.96,1:55:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆  我跟丢了 但丁抓走了小布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, I lost him. Dante has Little B.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.08,1:55:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  多米尼克  欢迎来到决战环节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dominic. Welcome to the big showdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.43,1:55:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛接近尾声了  瞧瞧我的副驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the last lap. Check out my copilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.88,1:55:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-爸爸 -谁能料到会是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad! - Who could've seen this coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.71,1:55:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,除了我之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you know, except for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.84,1:55:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,该死  我的燃油管好像坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. Looks like my fuel line's been shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.56,1:55:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-我追不上他  多姆 -雅各布  你跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't get to him, Dom. - Jakob, stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.91,1:55:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我要出局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out of this race.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.50,1:55:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,只能靠你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has to be you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.95,1:56:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨  多姆  为你准备了个小惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dom! Got a little surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.03,1:56:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你养了个好儿子  多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You raised a hell of a son, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.52,1:56:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我该从你的阴影里走出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for me to step out from under your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.66,1:56:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你点亮了我的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for showing me the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.45,1:56:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jakob?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.80,1:56:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我会为你铲除障碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go clear the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.63,1:56:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,去夺回你儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.67,1:56:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布  不要！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jakob, don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.01,1:56:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.89,1:56:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Jakob!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.67,1:57:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你的壮汉叔叔  没法参加下次的烧烤派对了  哈哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like Uncle Muscle won't be coming to the next barbecue.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.88,1:57:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.99,1:57:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说他死的真光荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's very honorable.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.13,1:57:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,距离5公里  驶入辅路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three miles away. Take the service road.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.34,1:57:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你能一路开到机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll lead you right to the airfield.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.49,1:57:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么在街头赛打败你爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how to beat your dad in a street race?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.70,1:57:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,把他带离街头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take away the streets.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.02,1:57:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.64,1:57:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.01,1:58:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的  没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got it. We got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.46,1:58:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,该我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.80,1:58:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害  你爸真厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's good. Your dad's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.46,1:58:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆  还有1.6公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, you got one mile left.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.15,1:58:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子  我说过我是信守承诺的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son, I never break a promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.19,1:58:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一起来上完那趟驾驶课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let's finish that driving lesson.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.68,1:58:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,感受车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel the car,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.16,1:58:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,找准线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}find your line
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.03,1:58:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,飞速疾驰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.00,1:59:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.84,1:59:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.01,1:59:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,现在走辅路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the service road now.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.47,2:00:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-我已经降落了 -我们现在就去找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm wheels down. - We're headed to you now.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.41,2:00:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你的人已经在路上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your team is on their way.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.41,2:00:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在机场汇合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll meet you at the airfield.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.13,2:00:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-你还好吗 -我没事了  爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - I'm good, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.24,2:00:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你骄傲  儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm real proud of you, son.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.91,2:01:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  小多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Dommy boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.25,2:01:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴再次见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.15,2:01:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才是用直升飞机打我了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hit me with a helicopter back there?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.67,2:01:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哼  哈哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.16,2:01:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好疼啊  你这个大块头  我懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow, you big brute. I mean, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.81,2:01:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你在儿子面前炫技呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're showing off in front of your son.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.23,2:01:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但说真的  你以为我那么容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But honestly, did you really think
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.61,2:01:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,就会被干掉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was going to be that easy?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.61,2:01:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,和我计划的一样  你到达了指定地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're exactly where I wanted you to be.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.03,2:01:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.96,2:01:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,等着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.79,2:01:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,给你准备的惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.73,2:01:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,骑士们到了  交给我们吧  多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cavalry's here. We got you, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.67,2:01:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,罗曼  快离开  这是圈套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roman, get out of here. It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.71,2:01:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们打过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.24,2:02:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.80,2:02:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是家人太多的问题所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, that's the problem with having a big family.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.97,2:02:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没法保护所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't protect 'em all.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.29,2:02:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  多米尼克  那是你的新朋友吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Dominic, is that your new friend?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.02,2:02:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你太有预见性了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are so predictable.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.68,2:02:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为所有人都会成为你的朋友吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think everyone's gonna end up on your side?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.10,2:02:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是爱姆斯首先是我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Problem is Aimes was mine first.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.34,2:02:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,行动已经开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the work begins.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.72,2:02:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那么从今天起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in there,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.35,2:02:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会将家族带上真正的权力之路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}today we'll put our family on a path to real power.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.90,2:02:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.40,2:02:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来我们的合作关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, looks like our partnership's
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.05,2:02:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,刚开始就很精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}off to a fantastic start.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.40,2:02:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗  多姆  想成为真圣人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Dominic, to become a real saint,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.16,2:03:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须能创造奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have to perform miracles.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.92,2:03:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,或者殉道而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or die a martyr.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.03,2:03:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你要怎么选择呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.88,2:03:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,(远程操控)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.39,2:03:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我夺走了你的钱  你的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took your money, I took your freedom,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.22,2:03:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要夺走你的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm gonna take your family.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.98,2:03:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你小命不保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're gonna die
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.39,2:03:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你的儿子也要一起死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knowing that you couldn't save your son.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.47,2:03:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.43,2:03:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,相信自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have faith.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.96,2:03:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你犯了个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made one mistake.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.52,2:03:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你没夺走我的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never took my car.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.62,2:06:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,折磨已经结束了  多姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The suffering is over, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.77,2:06:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候杀掉你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time for you to die.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.31,2:07:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.49,2:07:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还认为我的计划差劲吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still think my plan sucks?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.48,2:10:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,(未知来电)
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.14,2:10:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你好呀  伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howdy, partner.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.83,2:10:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢惊喜吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like surprises?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.97,2:10:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了一些令人发指的事情  警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done some dastardly, dirty deeds, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.42,2:10:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你带走了我生命中最珍贵的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took the most important thing in my life from me.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.85,2:10:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,多姆  在开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom drove the car.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.78,2:11:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-但是你… -救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But you... -  Help me.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.44,2:11:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,……你扣动了扳机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you pulled the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.24,2:11:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,现在  我要开始折磨你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I'm gonna make you suffer.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.94,2:11:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,魔鬼要来找你了……\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The devil is coming for you...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.88,2:11:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,警长先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lawman.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.40,2:11:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好找的  混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I ain't hard to find, you sumbitch.
